Authors and contributors
========================

David Malcolm <dmalcolm@redhat.com>
    Author and maintainer.  Design, direction, review, and the GCC
    domain knowledge the whole thing rests on.


AI assistance
-------------

Much of the implementation in this repository was written by Claude
Opus 5 (Anthropic) in interactive sessions, working from David
Malcolm's design, corrections and review.  This is recorded rather than
glossed over: the project is intended to validate a compiler, so how
its own code came about is something a reader should be able to see.

Individual files we jointly produced carry an SPDX tag:

    SPDX-FileContributor: Claude Opus 5 (Anthropic), AI assistant

Commits made with AI assistance should carry a trailer:

    Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Responsibility for the contents is the maintainer's, not the model's.
Everything here was reviewed by a human before being committed, and
several of the model's early conclusions were wrong and corrected in
review -- see the git history and TODO.md.


Third-party material
--------------------

No third-party benchmark code is vendored here; the suites are
referenced by path from config.json and remain under their own
licences.  See CITATIONS.md for how to credit them, and LICENSE for the
terms covering this harness.
